What the website is

Kapra Maihal is a small online clothing shop. It’s a static site, meaning plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript with no server of your own.

Pages: the home page (index.html) has a sliding photo banner, search, category chips and the product grid. The product page (product.html) has photos, size and colour choice, quantity and “More in…” suggestions. The contact page (contact.html) has phone, WhatsApp and email.
Products: they come from a Google Sheet through a Google Apps Script link set in config.js. They are cached in the visitor’s browser so the page loads quickly.
Cart and checkout: a slide-out cart saves in the visitor’s browser. Checkout asks for name, phone, city and address, with cash on delivery. The order is saved to your sheet, and the shop re-checks prices.
Extras: a WhatsApp message after ordering, a footer with your contact details, and a hidden field that catches spam bots.
